From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: rtw88: offload USB CCMP TX while retaining software RX

Keep RX MIC, PN and key-generation checks in mac80211. Offload only CCMP
TX and retain usb_sw_crypto as the full-software override. Receive-only STA
GTKs remain in software so they cannot replace an AP group CAM entry.

Propagate USB security-transfer failures through the existing fail-closed
TX boundary and confirm CAM programming/invalidation before slot reuse.

USB PTK0 replacement requires the companion mac80211 prepared-key retirement
patch (425). Together with the USB transport/MAC drain and software RX, it
allows the existing CAN_REPLACE_PTK0 advertisement to cover USB as well.

Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
